<Layout title="Drylining Leith | Partition Walls &amp; Ceilings Contractors" description="Professional drylining contractors in Leith. Expert partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard installation for Leith Walk, Waterfront, Shore, and the wider EH6 postcode region. Free quotes." canonical="/areas/leith/" schema={schema}>
  <section style="position:relative;min-height:400px;display:flex;align-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1a1a2e 0%,#16213e 100%);overflow:hidden;"> <img src="/images/hero-main.jpg" alt="Drylining services in Leith's Waterfront and Leith Walk" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.25;"> <div class="container" style="position:relative;z-index:1;text-align:center;padding:60px 20px;"> <nav style="font-size:13px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);margin-bottom:12px;"> <a href="/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Home</a> / <a href="/areas/" style="text-decoration:none;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.70);">Areas</a> / <span style="color:#ffffff;">Drylining in Leith</span> </nav> <h1 style="font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,44px);font-weight:800;color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:14px;line-height:1.15;">Drylining in Leith</h1> <p style="font-size:17px;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;line-height:1.6;">CSCS-accredited drylining contractors delivering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and plasterboard across Leith, the Waterfront, Leith Walk, and the wider EH6 postcode region.</p> </div> </section> <section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:900px;"> <div style="padding:24px;margin-bottom:24px;border-left:4px solid var(--primary);background:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius);border:1px solid var(--border);"> <p style="margin:0;font-size:15px;color:var(--text);"><strong>TL;DR:</strong> Drylining Leith provides drylining, partition walls, and suspended ceilings across Leith (EH6), including the Waterfront, Leith Walk, Shore, Great Junction Street, and the wider Leith area. Experienced with Victorian tenements, new build student accommodation, and commercial fit-outs.</p> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Drylining Services in Leith</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Leith is Edinburgh's vibrant seaside district, situated around 2 miles from the city centre along the Firth of Forth. The EH6 postcode covers a diverse area stretching from the historic Shore — with its colourful harbour buildings and independent cafes — to the long strip of Leith Walk, one of Edinburgh's busiest thoroughfares. The area is home to over 25,000 residents across a mix of 19th-century sandstone tenements, modern Waterfront developments, and post-war housing. Leith's ongoing transformation, driven by the Waterfront regeneration and the expanding retail and hospitality sector along Leith Walk, creates consistent demand for quality drylining services from domestic renovations to large-scale commercial projects.</p> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">The Waterfront area has seen significant new development in recent years, with residential apartments, office spaces, and mixed-use schemes bringing new opportunities for drylining contractors. Along Leith Walk, the retail and restaurant corridor continues to evolve with shop fit-outs, office conversions, and student accommodation projects. Our Leith crew covers the entire EH6 postcode, from the Shore's historic buildings through the commercial heart of Great Junction Street and the residential streets of the western wards. All work is carried out to Scottish Building Standards compliant with Sections 2, 3, and 4.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">What We Do in Leith</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Our Leith-based crew handles everything from tenement flat renovations along the Shore to commercial fit-outs at the Waterfront and along Leith Walk — covering partition walls, suspended ceilings, and fire-rated wall systems across the EH6 postcode area.</p> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><strong>Tenement flat drylining</strong> — Internal wall insulation, acoustic partitions, and room conversions in Leith's Victorian and Edwardian sandstone tenements</li> <li><strong>Waterfront new build drylining</strong> — Pre-completion drylining for new residential apartments and mixed-use developments at the Edinburgh Waterfront</li> <li><strong>Leith Walk commercial fit-outs</strong> — Retail unit refits, restaurant conversions, and office refurbishments along one of Edinburgh's busiest retail corridors</li> <li><strong>Student accommodation drylining</strong> — Fire-rated compartmentation and acoustic party walls in Leith's growing stock of student housing</li> <li><strong>Fire-rated walls</strong> — Multi-storey residential buildings requiring Scottish Building Standards Section 2 (Fire) compliance</li> <li><strong>Suspended ceilings</strong> — Commercial premises, hospitality venues, and new build apartments across the EH6 postcode</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Areas of Leith We Cover</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li>Leith Waterfront and Victoria Dock (EH6)</li> <li>Leith Walk — Great Junction Street to the Ocean Terminal end</li> <li>The Shore and Leith harbour area</li> <li>Logan Place and Newhaven</li> <li>Brown Street and Leith Central area</li> <li>Grange area (EH9) — adjacent to Leith</li> <li>Portobello area (EH15) — adjacent to Leith</li> <li>Shandon area (EH6)</li> <li>South Leith and Trinity area</li> <li>Newhaven and Gilmerton area</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Leith Building Regulations &amp; Planning</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">Leith falls under <strong>City of Edinburgh Council</strong> for building standards and planning. The Waterfront area contains several Category A and B listed buildings, particularly around Victoria Dock and the Shore. Several properties in Leith are within conservation areas, meaning internal structural alterations may require appropriate consents. We work closely with clients, architects, and the council's building standards department to ensure every project — from a tenement flat internal refurbishment to a Waterfront commercial fit-out — is fully compliant with Scottish Building Standards and any local conservation requirements.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Why Choose Us for Leith Projects</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">As an Edinburgh-based drylining team, we have extensive experience working across Leith. We understand the specific challenges of tenement work in this area, including narrow access streets, parking restrictions for materials, and the need to work around existing residents during internal refurbishments. Our crew is familiar with Scottish Building Standards and the particular requirements of working in a busy urban harbour district. Whether you need drylining for a tenement flat on Leith Walk, a Waterfront apartment conversion, or a shop fit-out on the Shore, our team delivers quality work on time.</p> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Related Services</h2> <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));gap:10px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <a href="/services/partition-walls/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Partition Walls</a> <a href="/services/fire-rated-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Fire-Rated Drylining</a> <a href="/services/acoustic-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Acoustic Drylining</a> <a href="/services/refurbishment-drylining/" style="text-decoration:none;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--white);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;border:1px solid var(--border);color:var(--text);">Refurbishment Drylining</a> </div> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Nearby Areas</h2> <ul style="list-style:disc;padding-left:1.5rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;font-size:1.0625rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem;"> <li><a href="/areas/edinburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Edinburgh City Centre</a> — 10 minutes via A8</li> <li><a href="/areas/musselburgh/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Musselburgh</a> — 20 minutes via A1</li> <li><a href="/areas/livingston/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Livingston</a> — 35 minutes via M8</li> <li><a href="/areas/dalkeith/" style="color:var(--primary);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Dalkeith</a> — 20 minutes via A702</li> </ul> <h2 style="font-size:1.75rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--secondary);margin:2.5rem 0 1rem;">Get a Free Leith Quote</h2> <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--text);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem;">We offer free, no-obligation site visits and written quotes for all drylining projects across Leith. Call us or fill in our quick form.</p> <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center;"> <a href="/get-quote/" class="btn btn-primary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;">Get a Free Leith Quote</a> <a href="tel:08008203090" class="btn btn-secondary" style="font-size:1.0625rem;padding:1rem 2.5rem;border:2px solid var(--primary);background:transparent;color:var(--primary);margin-left:0.5rem;">FREEPHONE 0800 820 3090</a> </div> </div></section>  
</Layout>